From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kevin Raneri <kevin.raneri@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 12:24:48 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Pufferfish: Optimize mob spawning

Original Pufferfish patch by Kevin Raneri, co-authored by booky10 (GPL-3.0-only). Frontier Paper 26.4 compatibility: snapshot entity, chunk and spawn cost data on the server thread; reduce only immutable data asynchronously; restore native LocalMobCapCalculator state on the server thread; retain synchronous fallback and thread shutdown.

Co-authored-by: booky10 <boooky10@gmail.com>

